WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

c001
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.944
The tall shaft is dark and filled with a dense web of wires and metal structures, extending upward.

c002
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.337
A second person with dark hair and light shirt enters behind the first.

c005
00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:44.547
Figures hang from wires and fall.

c006
00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:52.138
In a moment, second person walks as figures hang nearby.

c007
00:00:53.577 --> 00:00:57.014
In a moment, walkway tilts, figures slide off.

c008
00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:01.889
In a moment, first person catches up to second.

c011
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.822
The walkway tilts and breaks, causing the second person to fall.

c013
00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.089
Both figures fall through the wires into darkness.
